#### 
#### HOW TO USE THESE BASH PROMPTS?

#### Comment the one you don't want to use, uncomment the one you want to use. 
#### Script reads from top to bottom so if you have several uncommented, the last one will be activated. (not recommended)

#PS1='${debian_chroot:+($debian_chroot)}\[\033[01;32m\]\u@\h\[\033[00m\]:\[\033[01;34m\]\w\[\033[00m\]\$ ' #standard debian-like prompt
PS1='[${debian_chroot:+($debian_chroot)}\[\033[01;32m\]\u@\h\[\033[00m\]:\[\033[01;34m\] \w\[\033[00m\]]$ ' #standard Enterprise Linux-like Prompt (Fedora, RockyLinux, etc)

